          "text": "I walk. My office is near my home."
        },
        {
          "who": "B",
          "text": "That is nice. I take the bus."
        },
        {
          "who": "A",
          "text": "Is the bus full in the morning?"
        },
        {
          "who": "B",
          "text": "Yes, it is. I stand for twenty minutes."
        },
        {
          "who": "A",
          "text": "Oh no. That is long."
        },
        {
          "who": "B",
          "text": "I read a book on the bus."
